This regulation details the requirements and principles related to the appointment of employees at the University of Kentucky.

&nbsp;

Responsible Office:&nbsp;President

Outlines how the university supports student well-being and campus safety through coordinated care, referrals, crisis response and the Community of Concern Team.

Responsible Office/Official: &nbsp;Vice President for Student Success

&nbsp;

This regulation applies to all members of the University community and any other individual or entity operating or working with any programs in which a minor is a participant.

Responsible Office/Official: &nbsp;Executive Vice President for Finance and Administration

&nbsp;

This regulation establishes the policies and procedures for the terms of appointment and reappointment of Graduate Medical Education (GME) Residents and Fellows, and defines their status, privileges, and benefits.

&nbsp;

Responsible Office:&nbsp; EVPHA / Provost / GME
